# Architecture

Pipeline (do not skip or merge layers):

Broker observation
→ validated observations
→ MarketEnvironment
→ SensoryEncoder
→ MaleCNS / Mock / shuffled-control
→ BehaviorDecoder
→ Fly overlay
→ ProposalGuard
→ RiskEngine
→ Paper / Live Assist

Rules:

- Extension-first; Tauri is companion only.
- Broker parsing stays out of brain logic.
- MarketEnvironment stays broker-neutral and serializable.
- Do not invent large new architecture in wrap-up iterations.
- Prefer fixing real bugs over “prettier” redesigns.
